# Package Traits
<!-- Code generated by sidekick. DO NOT EDIT. -->

This package uses Swift package traits to conditionally compile individual service
clients and their associated types. Enabling a trait enables the corresponding
client and all the request, response, and model types needed to use that client.
{{#Codec.HasDefaultTraits}}

The following traits are enabled by default:
{{#Codec.DefaultTraits}}
- `{{{.}}}`
{{/Codec.DefaultTraits}}

To enable additional traits alongside the defaults, specify them in `Package.swift`:

```swift
.package(url: "https://github.com/googleapis/{{Codec.PackageRepoName}}.git", from: "{{Codec.PackageVersion}}", traits: [".defaults", "<TraitName>"])
```
{{/Codec.HasDefaultTraits}}
{{^Codec.HasDefaultTraits}}

No traits are enabled by default. Specify the traits you need in `Package.swift`:

```swift
.package(url: "https://github.com/googleapis/{{Codec.PackageRepoName}}.git", from: "{{Codec.PackageVersion}}", traits: ["<TraitName>"])
```
{{/Codec.HasDefaultTraits}}

